  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSSF Lebanon Livelihoods Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFID will provide up to &#xa3;4.7 million from the cross-Government Conflict, Stability and Security Fund (CSSF) between August 2015 and March 2016 to fund an employment promotion programme in Lebanon to address growing social tensions relating to the scarcity of employment opportunities and youth economic marginalisation. The programme will primarily target Lebanese host communities; however refugees will also stand to benefit from the programme both directly and indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
